Anthropic Cut Fable 5.2 price is 20% as Frontier Code 2.0 jumped to 49.1%. At X-High Effort that is up from 32.4%, the share of generated changes open source maintainers would accept. This is Models &amp; Agents, Episode 230, Meta's smallest hosted model, a dual-chip TPU in one rack, and open AI's control room follow, then things to try. Anthropic Computer World Reports shipped Claude Fable 5.2

