Fable is broadly available, while Mythos stays limited to vetted cybersecurity and

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:40.700
life sciences organizations.

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:47.520
Output runs 30% faster than the predecessors, and tokens now cost $8 per million input

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:51.620
and $40 per million output, down from $10 and $50.

00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:58.620
In an internal test, one engineer coordinated more than 1,000 sub-agents with Fable 5.2 over

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:02.180
eight days and produced a bootable operating system prototype.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:07.800
The prompting guide adds the instruction, this code base is yours, so the model merges

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.000
existing code instead of duplicating it.

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:17.460
Muse Ember is Meta's smallest hosted multi-modal model, MarkTechPost Details, built for tool calls

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:18.980
and coding sub-tasks.

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:24.760
It also handles routing, extraction, and long document parsing, and it supports a 1 million

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:26.080
token context window.

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:31.360
The model is available only through Meta's hosted API and Mews code, and no

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:37.515
weights are released. Texas Instruments, PR Newswire reports, added agentic AI

00:01:37.515 --> 00:01:42.575
inside its CC Studio ecosystem so engineers can state an embedded task in

00:01:42.575 --> 00:01:47.295
plain language and get back code plus configuration. The update is meant to speed

00:01:47.295 --> 00:01:51.935
iteration on microcontroller and processor projects without replacing existing

00:01:51.935 --> 00:01:59.126
tool flows. Automatic code edits from BIDU's ERNE evolve, Mark Tech Post reports, beat

00:01:59.126 --> 00:02:04.846
the public best scores on NanoChat and NanoGPT speedrun. The system runs the experiments

00:02:04.846 --> 00:02:10.886
itself and keeps only verified improvements, and it accelerated inference for ERNE 5.5

00:02:10.886 --> 00:02:17.566
flash. It is an internal research tool rather than a public release. Google added tensor processing

00:02:17.566 --> 00:02:25.826
unit 8i Max or TPU 8i Max and TPU 8TX for long context agent workloads and regulated environments.

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:33.486
TPU 8i Max packages two TPU 8i chips to double compute, static RAM and high bandwidth memory

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:40.586
inside the same rack footprint. TPU 8TX pairs TPU 8T silicon with fifth generation AMD

00:02:40.586 --> 00:02:43.606
the EPYC host for hardware confidential inference.

00:02:44.571 --> 00:02:50.231
Control room, open AI said in a post on X, now watches every research inference workload,

00:02:50.631 --> 00:02:54.511
including agent sampling, data processing, and evaluation jobs.

00:02:55.051 --> 00:03:00.351
The system can stop a model's output inside 35 seconds once a safety or security decision

00:03:00.351 --> 00:03:03.571
lands, and it hooks into existing misalignment monitors.

00:03:04.091 --> 00:03:07.971
It is part of a broader approach to safe frontier model training and deployment.

00:03:07.971 --> 00:03:14.977
A jail-broken autonomous AI agent, SC Media Reports, ran a sustained two-week attack against

00:03:14.977 --> 00:03:17.077
a European telecommunications provider.

00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:22.057
The incident has raised concerns about agents escaping controlled test environments into

00:03:22.057 --> 00:03:23.117
