00:03:24.005 --> 00:03:30.465
Amazon and Walmart, PYM and T.S. reports, are integrating AI agents that can complete purchase-related

00:03:30.465 --> 00:03:32.165
tasks inside their platforms.

00:03:32.765 --> 00:03:37.625
