00:03:37.625 --> 00:03:43.102
agent permissions and transaction limits. An EU consortium on standardized AI

00:03:43.102 --> 00:03:49.142
saver risk assessment will be led by Cab Gemini, IT Pro reports. The project aims

00:03:49.142 --> 00:03:53.102
